# Brenz Design System

Source: `@docs/product/brenz-design-system-decision.md`.

## Rules

- Use `BrenzDesignSystem` (`Packages/BrenzDesignSystem/`) for colors, typography, spacing and components.
- Read the theme with `@Environment(\.theme)`.
- Use semantic tokens: `background`, `surface`, `surfaceHigh`, `accent`, `water`, `tatami`, `textPrimary`, `textSecondary`, `border`, `characterCard`, `danger`.
- Load package resources with `bundle: .module`.
- Change the shape of a control with `ButtonStyle`, `LabelStyle` or `ViewModifier`.
- Mark `public` only what the app consumes.
- Add `#Preview` to every public component.
- Use Dynamic Type styles.
- Use the interface in dark mode only.
- Use `BrenzTabBar` for navigation (Train, History, Settings). Translucent background with `Material`.
- Use the package floating translucent sheet for discipline, class log and confirmations. Radius 40, blur, darkened background behind.
- Use `danger` only in destructive actions: solid fill with `background` text to confirm, or `danger` text on `danger` at 16 % for the secondary button.
- Show the result of an action with `BrenzSuccessMark` (animated checkmark). With "Reduce Motion", no animation.
- Read springs and durations from the package motion tokens. Apply the "Reduce Motion" modifier to every animation.
- Receive fixed texts as `LocalizedStringResource` and dynamic texts as `String`.
- Keep boards and speech bubbles without a border.

## Forbidden

- Do not use fixed colors (`Color(red:...)`, hex, `Color.green`, `Color.red`) in views.
- Do not import Firebase or app modules inside the package.
- Do not pass domain entities (`Character`, `BoardElement`, `BoardTheme`) to the package. Pass simple data.
- Do not add external dependencies to the package.
- Do not create more targets in the package.
- Do not write visible text literals inside the package.
- Do not move `DayBoard` into the package. It lives in `Presentation/Shared/`.
- Do not add light mode in v1.
- Do not use the `line` token in the interface. It is art only.
- Do not use `danger` in actions that do not destroy data.
- Do not put the delete-log flow inside the package. It lives in the History feature.

## Where new code goes

- Component without logic: `Packages/BrenzDesignSystem/Sources/BrenzDesignSystem/Components/`.
- Reusable style: `.../Styles/`.
- New token (color, spacing, motion): `.../Tokens/` and Asset Catalog in `.../Resources/`.
- View with logic or entities, shared across features: `Presentation/Shared/`.
- View with logic for a single feature: `Presentation/<Feature>/`.
